data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"text_2","delta":"Whether fees for a practitioner, such as a massage therapist, count as medical expenses depends on"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"text_2","delta":" the province or territory where the service is provided. (Canada Revenue Agency, \"Authorized medical practitioners for"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"text_2","delta":" the purposes of the medical expense tax credit\")\n\nThis is general information, not tax or insurance advice."}

